### 2. Update VoucherRequestServiceImpl.java (The Rejection Block)
In your processWorkflowAction method, we need to replace the rejection logic. We will write a query to fetch DISTINCT LAST_ACTION_BY from the workflow table, making sure to explicitly exclude the executorId (so the person rejecting it doesn't get a notification about their own rejection).
Find the **Handle REJECTION** block (around line 700) and replace it completely with this:
